<template>
  <main class="planning">
    <header><strong>VIOOH <span>/ SCREEN PLANNING</span></strong><nav><router-link to="/world">OASIS 人群模拟</router-link><router-link to="/audience-demo">路人参数实验</router-link><router-link to="/legacy">旧版项目</router-link></nav></header>
    <section class="hero"><small>库存 → 场景与人群 → 评分 → 预算组合</small><h1>让每一块屏幕的选择，都有依据。</h1><p>结合原始库存、现场照片与地区资料，比较不同观众的观看机会，在预算内选择屏幕与 SOT。</p></section>
    <p v-if="error" class="error" role="alert">{{ error }}</p><p v-if="notice" class="notice" role="status">{{ notice }}</p>
    <section class="panel import-panel"><div><h2>01 / 导入原始库存</h2><p>读取 UnfilteredFrames，保留原始字段；支持 .xlsx，最大 25 MB。</p></div><div class="actions"><label class="button">上传 Excel<input class="file" type="file" accept=".xlsx" :disabled="busy" @change="importWorkbook"></label><button :disabled="busy" @click="loadSample">使用 data/test.xlsx 测试</button><span v-if="project">{{ project.filename }} · {{ project.frames.length }} 条</span></div></section>
    <template v-if="project">
      <div class="workspace">
        <aside>
          <section class="panel"><h2>02 / 区域与资料</h2><div class="fields"><label>国家 / ISO<input v-model="options.filters.country" placeholder="如 USA"></label><label>城市<input v-model="options.filters.city" placeholder="按原始表字段筛选"></label><label>媒体市场<input v-model="options.filters.market"></label><label>场所类型<input v-model="options.filters.venue"></label><label>POI<input v-model="options.filters.poi"></label></div>
            <label>区域边界（可选 JSON）<input v-model="boundsText" placeholder="[最小纬度,最小经度,最大纬度,最大经度]"></label>
            <label>排除屏幕 ID（每行一个）<textarea v-model="excludedText" rows="2" /></label>
            <h3>社会学资料 / 消费者调研 · 可选</h3><label>资料类型<select v-model="documentKind"><option value="regional">区域社会学资料</option><option value="consumer">消费者调研</option></select></label><label class="button">上传 PDF / TXT / MD<input class="file" type="file" multiple accept=".pdf,.txt,.md" :disabled="busy" @change="uploadDocuments"></label>
            <ul><li v-for="d in project.documents" :key="d.name">{{ d.name }} <strong v-if="d.truncated">（已截断至 60000 字符）</strong></li></ul>
            <h3>现场照片 · 可选</h3><p>文件名使用屏幕 ID，或与 FRAMEIMAGEPATH 文件名一致；也可指定单块屏幕。图片只用于分析场景。</p>
            <label>关联屏幕 ID<input v-model="photoScreen" placeholder="批量按文件名关联时留空"></label><label class="button">上传现场照片<input class="file" type="file" multiple accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" :disabled="busy" @change="uploadPhotos"></label>
            <label>公开 HTTPS 图片 URL<input v-model="imageUrl" placeholder="需指定上方屏幕 ID"></label><button :disabled="busy || !photoScreen || !imageUrl" @click="addLink">关联图片链接</button>
            <details><summary>飞书图片</summary><p>文件夹链接不是图片。需可下载的图片文件 token，服务端配置 FEISHU_TENANT_ACCESS_TOKEN；或从飞书下载后上传。</p><label>文件 token<input v-model="feishuToken"></label><label>资源类型<select v-model="feishuKind"><option value="file">Drive 文件</option><option value="media">文档素材</option></select></label><button :disabled="busy || !photoScreen || !feishuToken" @click="addFeishu">获取并关联飞书图片</button></details>
            <p>已关联 {{ Object.keys(project.photos).length }} 张图片 · 已分析 {{ Object.keys(project.analyses).length }} 块屏幕</p>
            <label>多模态分析重点<textarea v-model="focus" rows="3" /></label><button :disabled="busy || !selectedIds.length" @click="analyzeSelected">分析勾选屏幕（{{ selectedIds.length }}）</button><p>批次逐块调用模型。先勾选重点候选屏幕，可控制调用量。无图片或资料时保留未知分项。</p>
          </section>
          <section class="panel"><h2>03 / 预算与投放条件</h2><div class="fields"><label>总预算<input v-model.number="options.budget" type="number" min="0.01" step="100"></label><label>预算币种<input v-model="options.currency" maxlength="3"></label><label>投放开始日期<input v-model="options.start_date" type="date"></label><label>投放天数（可留空）<input v-model.number="options.days" type="number" min="1" max="366"></label><label>预算估算天数<input v-model.number="options.planning_days" type="number" min="1" max="366"></label><label>库存曝光统计周期（天）<input v-model.number="options.impression_period_days" type="number" min="1" max="366"></label><label>DSP 费率（0–1）<input v-model.number="options.dsp_fee" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.01"></label><label>CPM 加价率<input v-model.number="options.cpm_markup" type="number" min="0" max="5" step="0.01"></label><label>SOT 步长<input v-model.number="options.sot_step" type="number" min="0.01" max="1" step="0.01"></label><label>最大 SOT<input v-model.number="options.max_sot" type="number" min="0.01" max="1" step="0.1"></label><label>同区域重复惩罚<input v-model.number="options.overlap_penalty" type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.1"></label></div>
            <p>无日期或天数时仅计算预算级建议。库存 IMPRESSIONS 按所填周期解释；默认 30 天，需按来源确认。</p>
            <label>汇率：1 单位原币 = 多少 USD（JSON）<textarea v-model="fxText" rows="3" placeholder='{"USD":1,"GBP":1.25}' /></label><div class="fields"><label>汇率来源<input v-model="options.fx_source" placeholder="来源 URL / 内部锁定报价"></label><label>汇率时点<input v-model="options.fx_date" type="date"></label></div>
            <label>替代方案不可用 ID（每行一个）<textarea v-model="alternativeText" rows="2" placeholder="留空则替代均衡方案投入最高的屏幕" /></label>
          </section>
          <section class="panel"><h2>04 / 可解释评分</h2><label>场景权重预设<select v-model="preset" @change="applyPreset"><option value="balanced">均衡 · 强调可见性、位置与市场</option><option value="roadside">道路 / 通勤 · 强调可见性</option><option value="retail">商业 / 购物 · 强调市场相关性</option></select></label>
            <div class="fields"><label v-for="(name,key) in dimensions" :key="key">{{ name }}<input v-model.number="options.weights[key]" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="1"></label></div><p>权重自动归一化；SCORE_P 仅展示为参考。未知分项使用中性先验 50，并展示证据缺口。</p>
            <label class="check"><input v-model="customEnabled" type="checkbox">增加自定义目标方案</label><div v-if="customEnabled" class="fields"><label v-for="(name,key) in dimensions" :key="key">{{ name }}<input v-model.number="customWeights[key]" type="number" min="0" max="100"></label></div>
            <button class="primary" :disabled="busy" @click="calculate">{{ busy ? progress || '处理中…' : '清洗、评分并比较预算方案 →' }}</button>
          </section>
        </aside>
        <div class="main-results">
          <section class="panel"><div class="section-heading"><h2>库存与评分卡</h2><span>{{ filteredFrames.length }} 条匹配</span></div>
            <div class="toolbar"><input v-model="search" placeholder="搜索 ID、地点、场所" aria-label="搜索屏幕"><select v-model="availability" aria-label="候选筛选"><option value="all">全部记录</option><option value="eligible">可用候选</option><option value="rejected">已排除</option></select><button @click="selectPage">勾选当前页</button><button @click="selectedIds=[]">清除勾选</button></div>
            <p v-if="dirty" class="notice">输入或证据已变更；下方仍为上次结果，请重新计算后导出。</p>
            <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>分析</th><th>屏幕 / 场所</th><th>状态</th><th>原始曝光</th><th>CPM</th><th>总分</th><th>详情</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="f in pagedFrames" :key="f.key"><td><input v-model="selectedIds" type="checkbox" :value="f.screen_id" :disabled="!f.screen_id" :aria-label="`分析 ${f.screen_id}`"></td><td><strong class="screen-id">{{ f.screen_id || '缺少 ID' }}</strong><small>{{ f.fields.VENUE_TAXONOMY_VALUE }}<br>{{ f.fields.CLOSEST_POI || f.fields.ADDRESS_LOCALITY }}</small></td><td><span :class="['badge',f.eligible ? 'good' : 'bad']">{{ f.eligible ? '候选' : '排除' }}</span></td><td>{{ format(f.impressions) }}</td><td>{{ f.currency }} {{ format(f.cpm) }}</td><td>{{ f.total_score?.toFixed(1) ?? '待计算' }}</td><td><button @click="detailId=f.key">查看</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
            <div class="pager"><button :disabled="page<=1" @click="page--">上一页</button><span>{{ page }} / {{ pageCount }}</span><button :disabled="page>=pageCount" @click="page++">下一页</button></div>
            <article v-if="detail" class="detail"><div class="section-heading"><h3>{{ detail.screen_id }}</h3><button @click="detailId=null">关闭</button></div><p>{{ detail.reasons.join('；') || '通过当前清洗检查' }}</p><ul><li v-for="w in detail.warnings" :key="w">{{ w }}</li></ul>
              <template v-if="detail.scores"><div v-for="(name,key) in dimensions" :key="key" class="score-line"><div><b>{{ name }} · {{ detail.scores[key].toFixed(1) }}</b><span>{{ detail.evidence[key].type }}</span></div><progress :value="detail.scores[key]" max="100"/><p>{{ detail.evidence[key].reason }}<br><small>来源：{{ detail.evidence[key].source }}</small></p></div><p>SCORE_P 原值：{{ detail.score_p_reference ?? '缺失' }}（未计入总分）</p></template>
              <template v-if="detailAnalysis"><h3>场景观察与代表性人群</h3><p v-for="(o,i) in detailAnalysis.observations" :key="i">[{{ o.kind }}] {{ o.statement }} · {{ o.source }}</p><article v-for="(a,i) in detailAnalysis.audiences" :key="i"><b>{{ a.name }} · {{ a.confidence }}</b><p>{{ a.passing }}；{{ a.staying }}<br>{{ a.reaction }}<br>依据：{{ a.basis }}</p></article><ul><li v-for="u in detailAnalysis.uncertainties" :key="u">{{ u }}</li></ul></template>
              <details><summary>保留的原始字段</summary><pre>{{ JSON.stringify(detail.original,null,2) }}</pre></details>
            </article>
          </section>
          <section class="panel"><h2>05 / 方案对比</h2><p v-if="!result">填写预算后运行。所有金额由代码计算；不会由模型生成预算数字。</p><template v-else>
            <div class="summary"><span>{{ result.summary.total }} 原始记录</span><span>{{ result.summary.eligible }} 候选</span><span>{{ result.summary.rejected }} 排除</span><strong>{{ result.finance.budget_only ? '预算级建议' : '按投放条件估算' }}</strong></div>
            <div class="plan-grid"><button v-for="p in result.plans" :key="p.strategy" :class="['plan-card',{active:activeStrategy===p.strategy}]" @click="activeStrategy=p.strategy"><b>{{ strategies[p.strategy] }}</b><strong>{{ result.finance.currency }} {{ money(p.total) }}</strong><span>{{ p.screen_count }} 块屏幕 · {{ p.region_cells }} 区域网格</span><span>估算曝光 {{ format(p.impressions) }}</span><span>剩余预算 {{ money(p.remaining) }}</span></button></div>
            <template v-if="activePlan"><p>{{ activePlan.excluded_ids.length ? `此替代方案排除：${activePlan.excluded_ids.join('、')}` : '按当前候选范围与 SOT 步长分配。' }}</p><p v-for="risk in activePlan.risks" :key="risk" class="notice">{{ risk }}</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>屏幕</th><th>SOT</th><th>估算曝光</th><th>媒体预算</th><th>DSP 费用</th><th>总投资</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="item in activePlan.items" :key="item.key"><td>{{ item.screen_id }}</td><td>{{ (item.sot*100).toFixed(0) }}%</td><td>{{ format(item.impressions) }}</td><td>{{ money(item.media_budget) }}</td><td>{{ money(item.dsp_cost) }}</td><td>{{ money(item.total) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>金额均以 {{ result.finance.currency }} 为主。总投资包含向上取整到分的预算预留，导出保留 USD 参考及汇率。</p><button class="primary" :disabled="busy || dirty" @click="exportExcel">导出 {{ strategies[activeStrategy] }} Excel</button></template>
            <h3>计算方法与风险</h3><dl><template v-for="(formula,key) in result.formulas" :key="key"><dt>{{ key }}</dt><dd>{{ formula }}</dd></template></dl><ul><li v-for="risk in result.risks" :key="risk">{{ risk }}</li></ul>
          </template></section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </template>
    <section v-else class="empty"><h2>从真实库存开始</h2><p>可直接加载项目样本验证流程，再替换为正式投放库存。地区资料和照片可稍后补充，缺失证据会显式标注。</p></section>
  </main>
</template>
<script setup>
import { computed, onMounted, ref, watch } from 'vue'
import api from '../api'
const project=ref(null),result=ref(null),busy=ref(false),error=ref(''),notice=ref(''),progress=ref('')
const dimensions={exposure:'曝光潜力',visibility:'可见性',location:'位置价值',market:'市场相关性',cost:'成本效率',availability:'可用性'}
const strategies={balanced:'均衡方案',coverage:'覆盖优先',venue:'场所价值优先',exposure:'曝光优先',alternative:'替代方案',custom:'自定义目标'}
const presets={balanced:{exposure:12,visibility:28,location:22,market:22,cost:10,availability:6},roadside:{exposure:15,visibility:40,location:20,market:10,cost:10,availability:5},retail:{exposure:10,visibility:25,location:20,market:30,cost:10,availability:5}}
const options=ref({budget:null,currency:'USD',start_date:'',days:'',planning_days:30,impression_period_days:30,dsp_fee:0,cpm_markup:0,sot_step:0.1,max_sot:1,overlap_penalty:0.5,fx_source:'',fx_date:'',weights:{...presets.balanced},filters:{country:'',city:'',market:'',venue:'',poi:''}})
const preset=ref('balanced'),fxText=ref('{"USD":1}'),boundsText=ref(''),excludedText=ref(''),alternativeText=ref(''),customEnabled=ref(false),customWeights=ref({...presets.balanced})
const photoScreen=ref(''),imageUrl=ref(''),feishuToken=ref(''),feishuKind=ref('file'),documentKind=ref('regional'),focus=ref('重点分析自然视线、遮挡、屏幕与道路关系、可能路过的人群及停留和观看机会。区分已知事实、图像观察与推测。')
const selectedIds=ref([]),search=ref(''),availability=ref('all'),page=ref(1),detailId=ref(null),activeStrategy=ref('balanced'),lastInput=ref(''),evidenceChanged=ref(false)
const inputSnapshot=computed(()=>JSON.stringify([options.value,fxText.value,boundsText.value,excludedText.value,alternativeText.value,customEnabled.value,customWeights.value]))
const dirty=computed(()=>!!result.value && (evidenceChanged.value || inputSnapshot.value!==lastInput.value))
const frames=computed(()=>result.value?.frames || project.value?.frames || [])
const filteredFrames=computed(()=>frames.value.filter(f=>(availability.value==='all'||(availability.value==='eligible'?f.eligible:!f.eligible)) && `${f.screen_id} ${f.fields.CLOSEST_POI} ${f.fields.ADDRESS_LOCALITY} ${f.fields.VENUE_TAXONOMY_VALUE}`.toLowerCase().includes(search.value.toLowerCase())))
const pageCount=computed(()=>Math.max(1,Math.ceil(filteredFrames.value.length/20)))
const pagedFrames=computed(()=>filteredFrames.value.slice((page.value-1)*20,page.value*20))
const detail=computed(()=>frames.value.find(f=>f.key===detailId.value))
const detailAnalysis=computed(()=>project.value?.analyses[detail.value?.screen_id])
const activePlan=computed(()=>result.value?.plans.find(p=>p.strategy===activeStrategy.value))
watch([search,availability],()=>page.value=1)
watch(pageCount,n=>{if(page.value>n)page.value=n})
const format=n=>n==null?'—':Number(n).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{maximumFractionDigits:0})
const money=n=>Number(n).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2})
const lines=s=>s.split('\n').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean)
function applyPreset(){options.value.weights={...presets[preset.value]}}
function selectPage(){selectedIds.value=[...new Set([...selectedIds.value,...pagedFrames.value.filter(f=>f.screen_id).map(f=>f.screen_id)])]}
async function task(fn){if(busy.value)return;busy.value=true;error.value='';notice.value='';try{await fn()}catch(e){error.value=e.message||'操作失败'}finally{busy.value=false;progress.value=''}}
function setProject(value,reset=false){project.value=value;try{localStorage.setItem('pdooh-planning-project',value.id)}catch{};evidenceChanged.value=true;if(reset){result.value=null;selectedIds.value=[];detailId.value=null;page.value=1;search.value='';availability.value='all'}}
async function loadSample(){await task(async()=>{setProject((await api.post('/api/planning/sample')).data,true);notice.value='已加载实际样本。请输入自己的总预算；样本中的占位图不会用于现场分析。'})}
async function importWorkbook(event){const file=event.target.files[0];if(!file)return;await task(async()=>{const form=new FormData();form.append('workbook',file);setProject((await api.post('/api/planning/import',form,{headers:{'Content-Type':'multipart/form-data'}})).data,true)});event.target.value=''}
async function uploadFiles(event,kind){const files=[...event.target.files];if(!files.length)return;await task(async()=>{const form=new FormData();files.forEach(file=>form.append(kind,file));if(kind==='photos')form.append('screen_id',photoScreen.value);else form.append('kind',documentKind.value);setProject((await api.post(`/api/planning/${project.value.id}/${kind}`,form,{headers:{'Content-Type':'multipart/form-data'}})).data);notice.value='证据已更新，请重新分析相关屏幕并计算方案。'});event.target.value=''}
const uploadPhotos=e=>uploadFiles(e,'photos'),uploadDocuments=e=>uploadFiles(e,'documents')
async function addLink(){await task(async()=>setProject((await api.post(`/api/planning/${project.value.id}/image-link`,{screen_id:photoScreen.value,url:imageUrl.value})).data))}
async function addFeishu(){await task(async()=>setProject((await api.post(`/api/planning/${project.value.id}/feishu-image`,{screen_id:photoScreen.value,file_token:feishuToken.value,kind:feishuKind.value})).data))}
async function analyzeSelected(){await task(async()=>{let done=0;const failures=[];for(const sid of selectedIds.value){progress.value=`分析 ${++done}/${selectedIds.value.length}`;const response=await api.post(`/api/planning/${project.value.id}/analyze`,{screen_ids:[sid],focus:focus.value});Object.assign(project.value.analyses,response.data.results);Object.entries(response.data.errors).forEach(([id,msg])=>failures.push(`${id}: ${msg}`));if(Object.keys(response.data.results).length)evidenceChanged.value=true}notice.value=`分析完成：${done-failures.length} 成功，${failures.length} 失败。${failures.join('；')}`})}
function config(){const value=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(options.value));value.fx=JSON.parse(fxText.value);value.exclude_ids=lines(excludedText.value);delete value.filters.bounds;delete value.alternative_exclude_ids;delete value.custom_weights;if(boundsText.value.trim())value.filters.bounds=JSON.parse(boundsText.value);if(alternativeText.value.trim())value.alternative_exclude_ids=lines(alternativeText.value);if(customEnabled.value)value.custom_weights=customWeights.value;return value}
async function calculate(){await task(async()=>{const snapshot=inputSnapshot.value;result.value=(await api.post(`/api/planning/${project.value.id}/plan`,config())).data;lastInput.value=snapshot;evidenceChanged.value=false;if(!result.value.plans.some(p=>p.strategy===activeStrategy.value))activeStrategy.value='balanced';notice.value=`已完成：${result.value.summary.eligible} 条候选，${result.value.plans.length} 个预算方案。`})}
async function exportExcel(){await task(async()=>{const blob=await api.get(`/api/planning/${project.value.id}/export`,{params:{strategy:activeStrategy.value},responseType:'blob'});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=`pDOOH-${activeStrategy.value}.xlsx`;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)})}
onMounted(async()=>{
  let id;try{id=localStorage.getItem('pdooh-planning-project')}catch{return}
  if(!id)return
  await task(async()=>{
    const response=await api.get(`/api/planning/${id}`);setProject(response.data,true)
    if(response.data.result){
      const saved=response.data.result;const o=saved.options
      options.value={...options.value,...o,filters:{...options.value.filters,...o.filters}}
      fxText.value=JSON.stringify(o.fx||{USD:1});boundsText.value=o.filters?.bounds?JSON.stringify(o.filters.bounds):''
      excludedText.value=(o.exclude_ids||[]).join('\n');alternativeText.value=(o.alternative_exclude_ids||[]).join('\n')
      customEnabled.value=!!o.custom_weights;if(o.custom_weights)customWeights.value=o.custom_weights
      result.value=saved;lastInput.value=inputSnapshot.value;evidenceChanged.value=false
    }
    notice.value='已恢复上次的库存项目和已保存方案。'
  })
})
</script>
<style scoped>
